    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "めぐるの母",
    "text": "６ペンス銀貨\r\nめぐるが結婚相手を連れてきた時にって思ってたんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "めぐるの母",
    "text": "お嫁さんの撮影が上手くいくように、おまじない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "おまじない……？　コインで？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "めぐるの母",
    "text": "花嫁が結婚式で身に着けると幸せになれる、４つのもの\r\nそれと、この６ペンス銀貨……そういう詩があるのよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "へぇー！　……ね、お母さんもそれ、やったの？\r\n──そっか！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030040"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ねぇねぇ、お母さんとお父さんが結婚式挙げた時って──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030050"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0237",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──なるほど、花嫁の靴にコイン……\r\nそんなおまじないもあるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "素敵だよね！\r\nこれなら、花嫁さんみたいにできるなって思って！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "撮影には影響しないから\r\n大丈夫かなって思ったんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "どうかな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、いいんじゃないか？\r\nめぐるの言うとおり、撮影に影響しないだろうし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ただし、カメラマンさんや衣装さんには確認しよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "はーい！　ありがとう、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030090"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "指示されたことをきっちりこなすことも大事だけど\r\nより良いものを作るために自分で考えることも大事だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "思うことやアイディアは、\r\n今回みたいにどんどん言ってほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "全部がそのとおりになるわけじゃないけど、\r\n糸口になることはきっとあるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……！　うん！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しかし、おまじないか……\r\n６ペンス銀貨以外の４つってなんなんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっとね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『何かひとつ古いもの、何かひとつ新しいもの、\r\n何かひとつ借りたもの、何かひとつ青いもの』",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『──そして、花嫁の左の靴には６ペンス銀貨を』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "これ、マザーグースのひとつって言われてるの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、前に話したやつか！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうそう！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "たとえば、『何かひとつ借りたもの』は\r\n友達やお隣さんとの縁をあらわすんだって",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "お母さんから借りた６ペンス、\r\n借りたものになるなぁって思って！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "これを持って撮影したら、\r\n少しは花嫁さんの気持ちもわかるかな？　って思ったの",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "本当は、幸せな結婚生活を送っている友達やお隣さんに\r\n何かを借りるらしいんだけどね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "友達に結婚してる人はいないし、\r\nそもそも、本当の結婚式じゃないし……！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか\r\n……うん、俺もアリだと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "せっかくならさ、他のも当てはめてみるのはどうだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "他の？　他のだと、撮影の時に困っちゃいそうだよ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "案外どうにかなるかもしれないぞ\r\n例えばさ……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "古いものはどうだ？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "新しいものはどうだ？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "青いものはどうだ？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "古い、の定義が難しいけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ほんとだ……新品じゃなければ\r\n古いものにしていいのかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……あっ！　そういえば……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "古いものって、先祖代々伝わってたり、\r\n家族に譲ってもらったりしたものって言ってたような……？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど\r\nそれも、６ペンス銀貨が当てはまるよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003011030250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200301103/2003011030250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "６ペンス、お母さんも使ったんだろ？\r\nそれにこのコイン、製造年が古いからさ……ほら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
